  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi></math> be the <math><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> terms respectively of a non-constant A.P.&nbsp;. If these are also the three consecutive terms of a&nbsp;G.P.&nbsp;, then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
